# Deck fixture circuit: the pilot loop with a chapter swap, puzzles and a mission.
kits scb20
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at A1 dir=right level=1
step 3: S1 at C1 dir=down level=1
step 4: L4 at D3 dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at A1 dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at D1 dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at C3 dir=up level=2
change colours: swap=4/D10
puzzle gap: S1=on, remove=6
puzzle lit: S1=on
mission yellow: swap=4/D10, flip=4 => S1=on: D10 yellow; S1=off: D10 off
scene watch: S1=on
expect S1=on: L4 on
